      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been meaning to check out the one world that offers subtitles on VRChat. Name starts with YTS I believe.\n\nFor speech to text (STT) I really want to reference https://xkcd.com/1425/ but STT done well is more of a cost issue, depending on what you're watching I think subtitles are likely better than trying to do something on the fly.\n\nI think the best move would be to see if AVPro by itself supports subtitles. If the third party video player would need to support something, that makes the feature request more difficult...\n\nThe YouTube viewer world that supports subtitles probably just has a good way to get subtitles for youtube video IDs and then handles it in world.",
