  "details": "Support for Closed Captioning in video players would greatly improve accessibility across the platform. Those who are deaf or hard of hearing (like myself) can more easily follow along with what's going on when we have something to read.\n\nThree parts to this request:\n\n1 - CC embedded within the video itself\n\n2 - Speech-to-Text conversion",
